    - key: 202
      value:
        matchups: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6887148f139f280438d9d67f651593e6, type: 2}
        description: 12,000 hull; 8,000 shields; speed 175. Four heavy 4-burst artillery-rocket
          launchers and two 6-burst barrage-rocket launchers. Targetable shield generator,
          two engines and tractor beam. Six light dual turbolasers, four heavy laser
          cannons and hangar are not separately targetable. Full Salvo accelerates
          rockets and slows other weapons. Tractor Beam restricts enemy movement.
          TIE-Interceptor complement.
        role: Artillery / Cruiser
        iconKey: 3896a253ad3c5024b8b7260fb0c214a9:21300000
        isHero: 0
        <Name>k__BackingField: "Victory I Star Destroyer \u2014 Advanced Loadout"
        <MaxCount>k__BackingField: 10
        <AvailableLevel>k__BackingField: 2
        <Price>k__BackingField: 12250
        <BuildTime>k__BackingField: 245
        <UnitCapacity>k__BackingField: 7
